worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_01.js"
  ceiling 1227
  rationale "Part of the mechanically split browser mirror of the Rust solver: issue #658 divided one oversized worker file by line count, so this shard has no subject of its own. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Ceiling 1224 (2026-10-07, R1017): the fallback evaluator applies a seeded math function to a parenthesized argument (applyMathFunction, keyed by the math_function_name meaning slug), the twin of link-calculator's sqrt/sin/ln support on the native path. Ceiling 1227 (2026-10-07, #1175 routing probes): normalizeArithmeticWords splits a CJK operator surface glued onto its operands ('12乘以7') so the token map reads it."
